      "sourceText": "`gimbal_yaw_fake` 是计算用的虚拟系：位置与 `gimbal_yaw` 重合，源码广播 `gimbal_yaw → gimbal_yaw_fake`，旋转取输入 yaw 的相反数，没有平移。在平面运动、输入位姿与机械 TF 正确且及时更新时，它的水平朝向与 `odom` 对齐，而位置跟着机器人走。它不是 `map`，也不是云台或底盘的世界原点；“方向与 odom 对齐”不表示完整坐标系与 odom 重合。源码只抵消 yaw，没有抵消 roll、pitch，坡面上不能直接套用完全水平的结论。",
      "translatedText": "`gimbal_yaw_fake` is a virtual frame used for computation: its position coincides with `gimbal_yaw`, the source code broadcasts `gimbal_yaw → gimbal_yaw_fake`, and its rotation takes the negative of the input yaw, with no translation\\. When the planar motion, input pose, and robot TF are correct and updated in a timely manner, its horizontal heading aligns with `odom`, while its position follows the robot\\. It is not `map`, nor is it the world origin of the gimbal or chassis; \"the orientation aligns with odom\" does not mean the complete coordinate frame coincides with odom\\. The source code only cancels yaw, not roll or pitch, so on a slope the fully horizontal conclusion cannot be directly applied\\.",
